{"id":"b1-u04","level":"b1","order":4,"title":{"en":"Food and drink","fr":"Nourriture et boissons","es":"Comida y bebida","ar":"الطعام والشراب"},"tip":{"en":"To ask politely, say what you want and add please. 'I want tea, please' works in any shop or café.","fr":"Pour demander poliment, dites ce que vous voulez et ajoutez s'il vous plaît. « Je veux du thé, s'il vous plaît » marche partout.","es":"Para pedir con educación, di lo que quieres y añade por favor. «Quiero té, por favor» sirve en cualquier tienda o café.","ar":"لتطلب بأدب، قل ما تريد وأضف من فضلك. «أريد شايا من فضلك» تصلح في أي محل أو مقهى."},"words":12,"lessons":[{"id":"b1-u04-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"tea, coffee, milk","fr":"thé, café, lait","es":"té, café, leche","ar":"شاي، قهوة، حليب"},"count":16},{"id":"b1-u04-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"couscous, rice, meat","fr":"couscous, riz, viande","es":"cuscús, arroz, carne","ar":"كسكس، أرز، لحم"},"count":16},{"id":"b1-u04-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"fish, egg, apple","fr":"poisson, œuf, pomme","es":"pescado, huevo, manzana","ar":"سمك، بيضة، تفاحة"},"count":16},{"id":"b1-u04-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"salt, I want, I eat","fr":"sel, je veux, je mange","es":"sal, quiero, como","ar":"ملح، أريد، آكل"},"count":13},{"id":"b1-u04-l5","type":"story","order":5,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":11},{"id":"b1-u04-l6","type":"review","order":6,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":13}]}
